698	      // `renderNodes(content, ...)`: `mention` is an atom/leaf node (`atom: true`, no content hole
699	      // — confirmed against the installed `@tiptap/extension-mention` dist), so `content` is always
700	      // `undefined` and that resolved to `""` — the whole mention silently vanished on the public

