 778	 * Within an owned type, `resolved` being `undefined` (no pre-existing caller of `renderSite` passes
 779	 * `pageHtmlEmbeds`), that type having no entry in `resolved`, or a ref's `id` being `null` (missing
 780	 * or invalid `id` key) all degrade identically to the public-safe REQ-28 marker — this function
 781	 * never distinguishes "unresolved" from "unresolvable" from "never attempted", never a crash and
 782	 * never literal, unresolved marker markup reaching a visitor.
