1382	 * selects an entry in {@link COMPONENTS}. An unknown component id degrades to an HTML comment, never
1383	 * a throw, so one bad reference cannot take the page down.
1384	 *
1385	 * Exported so the Liquid tag and the Handlebars helper are the same code rather than two
1386	 * implementations that must be kept in agreement.
