1441	  // this walk (`resolvePageWidgets`, threaded in via `ctx.widgetRegions`). Checked before the
1442	  // generic doc-vocabulary fallthrough so a region node is never mistaken for unknown content-doc
1443	  // vocabulary (which would try to walk its `content`, not its `key`).
