158	 * analogue is depth rather than breadth: deeply nested blocks recurse in both
159	 * Handlebars' own parser/compiler and in this walker, and a stack overflow
160	 * during the *lint* would happen on the main thread, outside any worker.
161	 * Capping the depth this walker will descend closes that, and no real theme
162	 * comes anywhere near 64 levels of nesting.
163	 */
