105	/**
106	 * Locate one marketplace fixture by its folder id, trying each {@link ENGINE_SUBFOLDERS} tier in
107	 * turn — mirrors how an installed theme's own folder name is authoritative for its id (`loadTheme`'s
108	 * `id`-must-equal-folder-name rule).
