136	/**
137	 * Read `theme.json` in `themeDir`, then overwrite it with `id` replaced and `extra` merged in. Used to
138	 * stamp each copy {@link downloadMarketplaceTheme} makes with its own assigned id (and, for the
139	 * editable copy only, its `lineage`). Every other authored field — `name` above all — passes through
140	 * untouched: only the folder-identity field changes, never the human-facing one, per the product rule
141	 * that a collision suffix belongs on the id/folder and never on the displayed name.
